        <mxCell id="s1oqWP0Pq4JOAUdTVW0R-76" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 0.75rem; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: -apple-system-body, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Stefan wants to add &lt;b&gt;HTTP request &lt;/b&gt;as an additional metric for scaling in and out, &lt;b&gt;alongside CPU and memory utilization&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 0.75rem; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: -apple-system-body, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;For example, if the &lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;index-working-serving&lt;/code&gt; service receives 50 requests within 3 minutes across the following paths: &lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;/api/v1/request/.*&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;/api/v1/semantic-concepts&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;/api/v1/data-schemas&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;/api/v1/similar_terms&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;/api/v1/similar_terms/csv/&lt;/code&gt;, the service will scale out from 1 pod to 2 pods to handle the increased traffic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 0.75rem; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: -apple-system-body, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve-breaks; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Once the number of requests drops below 20 within a 5-minute window, the service will scale back in from 2 pods to 1 pod.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="990" x="120" y="1080" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
